# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide describes how to migrate from the **server-side** implementations of IBM Quantum&reg;\n"
"`Sampler` and `Estimator` to their new **client-side** implementations in\n"
"`qiskit-ibm-runtime`. The interfaces and options are largely unchanged, so most code\n"
"runs as-is, but there are some behavioral differences to understand.\n"
msgstr ""
"Inilalarawan ng gabay na ito kung paano mag-migrate mula sa **server-side** na implementasyon ng IBM Quantum&reg;\n"
"`Sampler` at `Estimator` patungo sa kanilang bagong **client-side** na implementasyon sa\n"
"`qiskit-ibm-runtime`. Ang mga interface at opsyon ay karamihan hindi nagbago, kaya karamihan sa code\n"
"ay tatakbo nang as-is, ngunit may ilang pagkakaiba sa behavior na dapat unawain.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Kaligiran {#background}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sampler and Estimator are primitive *interfaces* defined in Qiskit. The IBM Quantum\n"
"Compute Service (formerly Qiskit Runtime) has historically provided the *implementation*\n"
"of these primitives inside its runtime environment. When you call `sampler.run()` or\n"
"`estimator.run()`, the request is sent to the service, and **all** computation — including\n"
"error suppression and mitigation — happens on the server side.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang Sampler at Estimator ay primitive *interface* na tinukoy sa Qiskit. Ang IBM Quantum\n"
"Compute Service (dating Qiskit Runtime) ay tradisyunal na nagbibigay ng *implementasyon*\n"
"ng mga primitive na ito sa loob ng runtime environment nito. Kapag tinawag mo ang `sampler.run()` o\n"
"`estimator.run()`, ipinapadala ang request sa service, at **lahat** ng computation — kabilang ang\n"
"error suppression at mitigation — ay nagaganap sa server side.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This black-box experience is convenient: you don't have to worry about implementation\n"
"details. But it also makes the primitives hard to debug, customize, or learn from,\n"
"because you can't see what happens during processing.\n"
msgstr "Maginhawa ang black-box na karanasan na ito: hindi mo na kailangang alalahanin ang mga detalye ng implementasyon. Ngunit dahil dito, mahirap ding i-debug, i-customize, o pag-aralan ang mga primitive, dahil hindi mo makikita kung ano ang nangyayari sa panahon ng processing.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The newly introduced [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model#directed-execution-model-beta) takes the opposite approach and\n"
"provides a **white-box** experience. All design intents are captured on the client side,\n"
"and a single server-side primitive [**Executor**](/guides/directed-execution-model#executor-primitive) processes those inputs exactly as\n"
"directed — it makes no implicit decisions on your behalf.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang bagong ipinakilalang [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model#directed-execution-model-beta) ay gumagamit ng kabaligtarang approach at\n"
"nagbibigay ng **white-box** na karanasan. Ang lahat ng design intent ay nakukuha sa client side,\n"
"at isang solong server-side na primitive [**Executor**](/guides/directed-execution-model#executor-primitive) ang nagpoproseso ng mga input na iyon nang eksakto ayon\n"
"sa direksyon — hindi ito gumagawa ng anumang implicit na desisyon para sa iyo.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Starting in `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0, Sampler and Estimator are re-implemented\n"
"on the **client side** on top of Executor. They provide the same convenience and\n"
"abstraction as before, and now you can inspect the implementation details when you need\n"
"to. Because the interfaces and options remain largely the same, migration should be\n"
"seamless.\n"
msgstr ""
"Simula sa `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0, ang Sampler at Estimator ay muling naipatupad\n"
"sa **client side** sa ibabaw ng Executor. Nagbibigay pa rin sila ng parehong convenience at\n"
"abstraction gaya ng dati, at ngayon ay maaari mo nang suriin ang mga detalye ng implementasyon kapag kailangan\n"
"mo ito. Dahil ang mga interface at opsyon ay karamihan hindi nagbago, dapat na maayos at walang aberya ang migration.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note: IBM Quantum only supports version 2 of Sampler and Estimator interfaces (`BaseSamplerV2` and `BaseEstimatorV2`). Therefore, they are simply referred to as Sampler and Estimator in this guide.\n"
msgstr "Tandaan: Sinusuportahan lang ng IBM Quantum ang version 2 ng Sampler at Estimator interface (`BaseSamplerV2` at `BaseEstimatorV2`). Kaya, tinutukoy lang sila bilang Sampler at Estimator sa gabay na ito.\n"

