msgstr "I-enable ang INFO logging {#enable-info-logging}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because more work now happens on the client side, it's useful to see the progress of that\n"
"processing. Enable INFO-level logging for the `qiskit_ibm_runtime` logger:\n"
msgstr ""
"Dahil mas maraming trabaho na ngayon ang nagaganap sa client side, kapaki-pakinabang na makita ang progress ng\n"
"processing na iyon. I-enable ang INFO-level logging para sa `qiskit_ibm_runtime` logger:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform explicit noise learning for PEA and PEC {#perform-explicit-noise-learning-for-pea-and-pec}"
msgstr "Magsagawa ng explicit na noise learning para sa PEA at PEC {#perform-explicit-noise-learning-for-pea-and-pec}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The new Estimator no longer performs *implicit* noise learning when the PEA or PEC error\n"
"mitigation method is selected. You must learn the noise models explicitly and pass them\n"
"in. Use the new [`NoiseLearnerV3`](/guides/noise-learning#noiselearnerv3) to control how circuits\n"
"are stratified into layers. It takes a list of boxed circuit instructions (for example,\n"
"the unique layers) as input.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang bagong Estimator ay hindi na nagsasagawa ng *implicit* na noise learning kapag pinili ang error\n"
"mitigation method na PEA o PEC. Kailangan mong matutunan ang mga noise model nang explicit at ipasa\n"
"ang mga ito. Gamitin ang bagong [`NoiseLearnerV3`](/guides/noise-learning#noiselearnerv3) para kontrolin kung paano na-stratify ang mga circuit\n"
"sa mga layer. Kumukuha ito ng listahan ng mga boxed circuit instruction (halimbawa,\n"
"ang mga unique layer) bilang input.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Important\">\n"
"PEA and PEC now **require** this explicit pattern. Do not skip the noise-learning step\n"
"or your code will fail. Measurement noise learning for TREX is unaffected and continues to work as before.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mahalaga\">\n"
"**Kinakailangan** na ngayon ng PEA at PEC ang explicit na pattern na ito. Huwag laktawan ang hakbang ng noise-learning\n"
"o mabibigo ang iyong code. Hindi apektado ang measurement noise learning para sa TREX at patuloy itong gumagana gaya ng dati.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Similarly, if your code uses `NoiseLearner` and passes the resulting noise model to server-side Estimator, you need to [migrate to `NoiseLearnerV3`](/guides/migrate-to-noise-learner-v3). Do NOT use the older `NoiseLearner`, which is incompatible with the new Estimator.\n"
msgstr "Gayundin, kung ang iyong code ay gumagamit ng `NoiseLearner` at ipinapasa ang resultang noise model sa server-side na Estimator, kailangan mong [mag-migrate patungo sa `NoiseLearnerV3`](/guides/migrate-to-noise-learner-v3). HUWAG gamitin ang mas lumang `NoiseLearner`, na hindi compatible sa bagong Estimator.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
