# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test locally with a fake backend {#test-locally-with-a-fake-backend}"
msgstr "Mag-test nang lokal gamit ang fake backend {#test-locally-with-a-fake-backend}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before submitting to hardware, you can validate the migrated code against a `Fake*`\n"
"backend to catch any syntax errors early. Note the following details about local testing mode:\n"
msgstr ""
"Bago mag-submit sa hardware, maaari mong i-validate ang na-migrate na code laban sa `Fake*`\n"
"na backend para maagap na mahuli ang anumang syntax error. Tandaan ang sumusunod na detalye tungkol sa local testing mode:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**It does not reproduce hardware results.** Local noisy simulation does not perfectly\n"
"replicate real device noise, and therefore the outputs might differ. Running does validate\n"
"that the option paths and value types are correct.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Hindi nito ginagaya ang mga resulta ng hardware.** Ang local noisy simulation ay hindi perpektong\n"
"gumagaya sa noise ng totoong device, kaya maaaring magkaiba ang mga output. Sinusuri pa rin ng pagpapatakbo\n"
"kung tama ang mga option path at value type.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- `NoiseLearnerV3` has **no local testing mode**: its `mode` accepts only a real `Backend`,\n"
"`Session`, or `Batch`, so you cannot exercise the noise-learning step against a fake\n"
"backend. Verify that part of your code against the\n"
"[`NoiseLearnerV3` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3) instead. Confirm that the constructor,\n"
"the `run(instructions)` input shape, and any helper (such as the unique-layer helper) are\n"
"used as documented.\n"
msgstr ""
"- Ang `NoiseLearnerV3` ay **walang local testing mode**: tinatanggap lang ng `mode` nito ang totoong `Backend`,\n"
"`Session`, o `Batch`, kaya hindi mo masusubok ang hakbang ng noise-learning laban sa fake\n"
"na backend. Sa halip, i-verify ang bahaging iyon ng iyong code laban sa\n"
"[`NoiseLearnerV3` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3). Kumpirmahin na ang constructor,\n"
"ang input shape ng `run(instructions)`, at anumang helper (tulad ng unique-layer helper) ay\n"
"ginagamit ayon sa dokumentasyon.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cliffordize the circuit for efficient local simulation {#cliffordize-the-circuit-for-efficient-local-simulation}"
msgstr "I-Cliffordize ang circuit para sa episyenteng lokal na simulation {#cliffordize-the-circuit-for-efficient-local-simulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A fake backend uses a statevector (noisy) simulator, whose cost grows exponentially with\n"
"qubit count and depth. Thus, a realistic workload circuit can hang or exhaust memory. Since\n"
"local testing only needs to exercise the option paths (not reproduce physical results),\n"
"reduce the circuit to a Clifford one first with\n"
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford),\n"
"which rounds each `RZ`/`RZZ`/`RX` angle to the nearest multiple of π/2. Clifford circuits\n"
"simulate efficiently (stabilizer simulation) regardless of size.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang fake backend ay gumagamit ng statevector (noisy) simulator, na ang gastos ay lumalaki nang exponential kasabay ng\n"
"bilang ng qubit at lalim. Kaya, maaaring mag-hang o maubusan ng memory ang isang makatotohanang workload circuit. Dahil\n"
"ang local testing ay kailangan lang na masubok ang mga option path (hindi kailangang gayahin ang pisikal na resulta),\n"
"bawasan muna ang circuit sa isang Clifford na circuit gamit ang\n"
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford),\n"
"na nagro-round ng bawat anggulo ng `RZ`/`RZZ`/`RX` sa pinakamalapit na multiple ng π/2. Ang mga Clifford circuit ay\n"
"nagsi-simulate nang episyente (stabilizer simulation) anuman ang laki.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ConvertISAToClifford` **requires an ISA circuit** as input (the output of\n"
"`generate_preset_pass_manager(...).run(...)` targeting the backend). You must account for the following consequences\n"
"when constructing the local PUB:\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kinakailangan ng `ConvertISAToClifford` ang isang ISA circuit** bilang input (ang output ng\n"
"`generate_preset_pass_manager(...).run(...)` na naka-target sa backend). Kailangan mong isaalang-alang ang sumusunod na konsekwensya\n"
"kapag gumagawa ng lokal na PUB:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The `.layout` attribute is dropped.** The Cliffordized circuit keeps the same qubit\n"
"count, but `clifford.layout` is `None`, so `observable.apply_layout(clifford.layout)`\n"
"fails. Lay the observable out from the **pre-Clifford ISA** circuit instead:\n"
"`isa_obs = observable.apply_layout(isa_circuit.layout)`, then run `(clifford, isa_obs)`.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Naaalis ang `.layout` attribute.** Pinapanatili ng Cliffordized na circuit ang parehong bilang ng\n"
"qubit, ngunit ang `clifford.layout` ay `None`, kaya nabibigo ang `observable.apply_layout(clifford.layout)`.\n"
"Sa halip, i-layout ang observable mula sa **pre-Clifford ISA** na circuit:\n"
"`isa_obs = observable.apply_layout(isa_circuit.layout)`, saka patakbuhin ang `(clifford, isa_obs)`.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Parameters are bound away.** Rounding the rotation angles turns a parametric ISA circuit\n"
"into a concrete Clifford one, so `clifford.num_parameters` becomes `0`. A PUB that still\n"
"carries a parameter-values array fails coercion. For the local run, drop the parameter\n"
"array from the PUB; the hardware run keeps the original parametric circuit and its values.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Naaalis ang mga parameter.** Ang pag-round sa mga anggulo ng rotation ay ginagawang concrete Clifford\n"
"na circuit ang isang parametric na ISA circuit, kaya nagiging `0` ang `clifford.num_parameters`. Ang isang PUB na may dala pa ring\n"
"parameter-values array ay mabibigo sa coercion. Para sa lokal na run, alisin ang parameter\n"
"array mula sa PUB; pinapanatili ng hardware run ang orihinal na parametric na circuit at ang mga value nito.\n"

